    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6904" root="حبس" body-key="H">
    
      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تحبّس عَلَى كَذَا</span></b>  <i>He confined, restricted,
limited, restrained,</i> or <i>withheld, himself</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَبَسَ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَفْسَهُ</span>) <i>to such a thing.</i> (S, K.) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تحبّس عَنِ الرُّكْبَانِ</span>
<i>He held back from the riders.</i> (TA.) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تحبّس فِى</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الأَمْرِ</span> [<i>He withheld himself,</i> or <i>held back, in,</i> or
<i>respecting, the affair</i>]. (TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حوز</span>.)

